able snapshot; a partial chain with a missing metadata reference fails with a stable diagnostic instead of silently dropping editor provenance. The complete graph and failure path are gated across memory, file, and SQLite\nrewrite-app/README.md:840:- the pinned original `SysCheck.xml` and byte-exact official `CY_SysCheck_2.xml` import as first-class system-check definitions without producing empty content releases. Multiple checks remain independently selectable in one workspace; the browser gate proves the measured-network and configured-`skipnetwork` paths, required-field feedback, every original questionnaire control, two resolved Verona runs, save-key reports, statistics, and check-isolated cleanup. Separately uploaded SysCheck, Unit, IQB coding-scheme, and Verona files resolve transitively into audited immutable packages; their Unit definition and Player stay attached to each check, and a packaged missing Unit is rejected with a stable diagnostic. `/system-check` is a lazy direct-entry Angular flow for browser/device capture, configured repeated upload/download throughput against original-compatible `/speed-test/random-package` endpoints, application latency and connection hints, original threshold ratings, per-check `syscheck_*` custom texts, Original report cancellation, and report persistence. Matching the Original welcome check, a cache-disabled public server-time contract compares the browser clock and IANA timezone with the configured participant timezone; deviations of at least 60 seconds and timezone mismatches are highlighted and retained in the saved environment report, while an unavailable check remains visible as a warning. The Original 800 × 600 minimum screen resolution is evaluated and highlighted in the same report. The Original's UAParser-based CPU architecture, device model/type/vendor, browser and major version, operating system and version, cookie/language/core values, and available browser-plugin names are captured with the upstream report 