art even for a single check, authored labels\nand descriptions, and the home action. Rewrite tenant/workspace diagnosis inputs\nare absent from this selection. A metadata-only directory returns no report key,\nUnit definition, Player or release payload; identical check IDs in different\nworkspaces remain separate choices. Dedicated system-check sessions see only\ntheir authorized scopes; invalid credentials do not fall back to public access.\nHeadful checks passed empty/single/multiple selection, actual scoped selection,\n390px layout bounds, one error notice and real retry, required password change,\nre-login and sign-out. The corresponding selection cases are in the repository\nbrowser gate. The protected login card and the remaining check steps still use\n🎭 Playwright Skill - Universal Executor\n\n📄 Executing file: /tmp/playwright-test-sqlite-save-contention.js\n🚀 Starting automation...\n\nowned_artifacts=/tmp/testcenter-sqlite-save-contention-7T2Hwk\n(node:62238) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n(node:62230) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n{\"lock\":\"reader\",\"elapsed\":1748,\"lockMs\":750,\"continuedWhileLocked\":true,\"blockedSaveMs\":787,\"failures\":[]}\nreader_save=200; waited_ms=1748; actual Player answer persisted in same run\n(node:62230) ExperimentalWarning: SQLite is an experimental feature and might change at any time\n(Use `node --trace-warnings ...` to show where the warning was created)\n{\"lock\":\"writer\",\"elapsed\":5823,\"lockMs\":751,\"continuedWhileLocked\":true,\"blockedSaveMs\":790,\"failures\":[]}\nwriter_save=200; waited_ms=5823; actual Player answer persisted in same run\nsqlite_contention_browser=passed; both locks; no HTTP 5xx/page errors\nowned_api=shutdown\nok 45 - malformed or unrelated JSON cannot pass canonical response matching\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.087083\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n1..45\n# tests 45\n# suites 0\n# pass 45\n# fail 0\n# cancelled 0\n# skipped 0\n# todo 0\n# duration_ms 621.290625\n  ...\n1..161\n# tests 161\n# suites 0\n# pass 161\n# fail 0\n# cancelled 0\n# skipped 0\n# todo 0\n# duration_ms 73479.597\n"},"started_at_ms":1791124300723,"completed_at_ms":1791124300725}}
